The first unverified <a href="https://browser.geekbench.com/v7/cpu/354109">benchmark result</a> for Apple's <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/25/apple-reveals-m6/">new M6 chip</a> surfaced in the Geekbench 7 database today, offering a look at the chip's performance gains. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/25/apple-announces-2026-mac-mini/">new Mac mini</a> will be Apple's first device to be equipped with the M6 chip, which is 2nm.<br/>
